{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/data.dart:offset-15414", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/data.dart", "location": "offset-15414", "text": "'Scores every day again from what is stored. Needed '\n'after a long-haul flight, and after an import that '\n'landed days out of order'", "sha256": "b365b58a77a50a77bf31b5286ed3b4b51684f14b277c3d38f15abbeefd4d8a6f", "kind": "dart", "start": 15414, "end": 15608, "line": 341}
