{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-33202", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-33202", "text": "'Screenless, no subscription, worn around the clock, with beat-to-beat '\n'intervals the vendor documents. Nobody has written the driver.'", "sha256": "8862720c65c9e5f795ada0894d68d924f5a836a106412d4831cf9b8fb09dbfa0", "kind": "dart", "start": 33202, "end": 33347, "line": 770}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-33406", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-33406", "text": "'Fitbit, Withings, Xiaomi and Zepp bands'", "sha256": "33ab6a9aee30ec0f14e8d14a11cb8ef9b5560bc963aba90894ebf87e614931e0", "kind": "dart", "start": 33406, "end": 33447, "line": 776}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-33453", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-33453", "text": "'Their pairing key is issued by the vendor’s own server. A driver would '\n'work only while their app stayed installed and signed in, and would '\n'stop the day they changed it — so the band would be ours to support '\n'and theirs to switch off.'", "sha256": "32396647db89dc81785ef2c188048e9b890b135f8b9e777c74181ce73c8f46c4", "kind": "dart", "start": 33453, "end": 33720, "line": 777}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-33726", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-33726", "text": "'Not a matter of time'", "sha256": "c717c88447e833547fe1768a8fa9a0b766793cdea6264f3ab539c05e3b9e795c", "kind": "dart", "start": 33726, "end": 33748, "line": 781}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-37424", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-37424", "text": "'Metrics that depend on the sensor use this band’s own constants, so two '\n'different bands can land on different tiers for the same physiology.'", "sha256": "6f99da2cb3c26ca962a61c08c2753872a5eed17789fe3ce7de3e6ca65d5aa5c8", "kind": "dart", "start": 37424, "end": 37579, "line": 872}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-37933", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-37933", "text": "'Not stated yet'", "sha256": "d0269e85319810b2b341cf84465e77db1fa0476321b8ed6a7c3455895a315270", "kind": "dart", "start": 37933, "end": 37949, "line": 882}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-37955", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-37955", "text": "'This band has not said which generation it is, and imported or older '\n'days never will. Metrics that depend on the sensor abstain rather '\n'than borrow another band’s numbers.'", "sha256": "0e7332135c90306be809c6e9385d61d52379e0b81410e62668a67b21da6bb686", "kind": "dart", "start": 37955, "end": 38149, "line": 883}
