{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-42395", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-42395", "text": "'Motion coprocessor'", "sha256": "f91179a77bc2e817e9ee93234062bd35292880601c4bcfb5a4ec4e4641dc93c9", "kind": "dart", "start": 42395, "end": 42415, "line": 993}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-47111", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-47111", "text": "'A chest strap or armband. Beat timing measured electrically, '\n'which a wrist pulse cannot match. Runs during a workout.'", "sha256": "c29907aae7edaaa257b32a8225eda7e4d153c77aec42b9f600a074c3217fee9e", "kind": "dart", "start": 47111, "end": 47241, "line": 1092}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-47408", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-47408", "text": "'Reads the ring directly, with no Oura account and no subscription. '\n'The ring must be factory reset FIRST — one that is already set up in '\n'the Oura app cannot be re-keyed. Reset it from the Oura app (remove/'\n'unpair the ring), then close that app before pairing here.'", "sha256": "c8ab54dc21b77020cdad81088f771cddcf6880a6d7411793206e27e3c57c06b1", "kind": "dart", "start": 47408, "end": 47705, "line": 1100}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-47773", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-47773", "text": "'A Polar Verity Sense or OH1. Beat timing measured optically, '\n'streamed during a workout, same as a chest strap.'", "sha256": "70ec3936592e069656dc3e165c1c54c71002e89bb4f5c828ab038da6bff6e2fd", "kind": "dart", "start": 47773, "end": 47896, "line": 1108}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-48115", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-48115", "text": "'An unbranded smart ring sold under many storefront names '\n'(not the Colmi R11/R12). No account or key needed. Banks its own '\n'data; nothing else derives from it yet.'", "sha256": "981d0cd26c35c714feaae30b80b73188e4c67da345c7f3f6ff75008e9c7c4635", "kind": "dart", "start": 48115, "end": 48300, "line": 1117}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-48547", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-48547", "text": "'A Coros sports watch. Reads battery, model/serial/firmware and '\n'live heart rate — no pairing needed. Recorded runs, sleep and steps '\n'stay on the watch; there is no public way to pull them off yet.'", "sha256": "7e89730987550948462f69400116f33b6831fbec8f681a485896628f8afdb67a", "kind": "dart", "start": 48547, "end": 48765, "line": 1127}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-48926", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-48926", "text": "'A Garmin sports watch. Before pairing here, put the watch into '\n'its own Settings → Sensors & Accessories → Phone → Pair Phone '\n'screen — it will not accept a new connection otherwise. Reads its '\n'model, firmware and battery; nothing else derives from it yet.'", "sha256": "5abc236b79ebd91bac61a906f516de45f1a6e995e29fc522b2dd7f12266ffdde", "kind": "dart", "start": 48926, "end": 49214, "line": 1136}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-49464", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-49464", "text": "'Reads the ring directly. No account, no key exchange — just pair '\n'it like a chest strap.'", "sha256": "3871f1238071dd3433f860203bb9f5a928c40ae4a3afd3c2713b06f88e3893bb", "kind": "dart", "start": 49464, "end": 49564, "line": 1147}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-49774", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-49774", "text": "'Pairs and connects, with no account and no subscription. Nothing '\n'it captures is decoded into a number yet — no one on this project '\n'has held one.'", "sha256": "de879bba9980de5932aabebeeabe2952e10911c5c4a289c6fcfe302870bb8c11", "kind": "dart", "start": 49774, "end": 49942, "line": 1155}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-50018", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-50018", "text": "'A Mi Band 2, 3 or 4. It must have no key installed yet — one '\n'still bound to Mi Fit or Zepp will refuse to pair. Unpair it from '\n'that app first, or use a factory-reset unit. Pairs and connects; '\n'nothing derives from it yet.'", "sha256": "3b10543999d5413359f725e515e4709ffe79582d6a647fe2e96f409e7e8daeda", "kind": "dart", "start": 50018, "end": 50273, "line": 1162}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-50340", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-50340", "text": "'Pebble 2 or Pebble 2 SE only — older Pebbles need Bluetooth '\n'Classic, which this app cannot reach. Nothing is decoded yet — raw '\n'bytes are archived for a future update to make sense of.'", "sha256": "486e5380fed72788cfac148006286b338727f05a4ca1209148ada419c033c266", "kind": "dart", "start": 50340, "end": 50547, "line": 1170}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-50713", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-50713", "text": "'An unbranded Makibes HR3 board. Pairs and banks its raw data in '\n'the background, but does not derive anything from it yet — nobody '\n'on this project owns one to verify its numbers against.'", "sha256": "39e7457f369e03907e4471bce9b6abd4e014d91a946acf109022450295100ab2", "kind": "dart", "start": 50713, "end": 50922, "line": 1179}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-51098", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-51098", "text": "'An unbranded ID115 board. Pairs and banks its raw data in the '\n'background, but does not derive anything from it yet — nobody on '\n'this project owns one to verify its numbers against.'", "sha256": "fe18eb545d6611464dc116c28d8b8e0ab6f34a8273fb8dbd2ca0c9a928766f00", "kind": "dart", "start": 51098, "end": 51301, "line": 1188}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-51480", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-51480", "text": "'An SMA-Q2-OSS smartwatch. Pairs and banks its raw data in the '\n'background, but does not derive anything from it yet — nobody on '\n'this project owns one to verify its numbers against.'", "sha256": "043aac9becfe91326ac5c8b145c78d66c5b549c21c67a9749133711c150634a0", "kind": "dart", "start": 51480, "end": 51683, "line": 1197}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-51860", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-51860", "text": "'An unbranded XWatch board. Pairs and banks its raw data in the '\n'background, but does not derive anything from it yet — nobody on '\n'this project owns one to verify its numbers against.'", "sha256": "255b3e9f258fdfc39ce4271eba8bcbaf0367ea5b8e171d5b9b7782d7f2f01c08", "kind": "dart", "start": 51860, "end": 52064, "line": 1206}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-52241", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-52241", "text": "'An unbranded Watch9 board. Pairs and banks its raw data in the '\n'background, but does not derive anything from it yet — nobody on '\n'this project owns one to verify its numbers against.'", "sha256": "199d13799b203f46266b4326c6300ec4cd94c45d4571dbd2b1f8cf3a27753ed3", "kind": "dart", "start": 52241, "end": 52445, "line": 1215}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-52623", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-52623", "text": "'A TLW64 or NO1 F1 fitness band. Pairs and banks its raw data in '\n'the background, but does not derive anything from it yet — nobody '\n'on this project owns one to verify its numbers against.'", "sha256": "5bb9b17291cfd0a77905dc3372f9f1e0ed9e3a459d69c60d55d9b7692af6b601", "kind": "dart", "start": 52623, "end": 52832, "line": 1224}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-53008", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-53008", "text": "'An unbranded DaFit/MOYOUNG-style watch, sold under many storefront '\n'names. Banks its own data; nothing else derives from it yet.'", "sha256": "7a3c75fca5d42c3ae131452ce488a3228fd2f12f037bad5a6ad8430a6cdca5e6", "kind": "dart", "start": 53008, "end": 53148, "line": 1233}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-53406", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-53406", "text": "'Reads its battery, model and serial. No SpO2 or pulse reading '\n'from the ring itself appears anywhere in the app yet.'", "sha256": "496a3c1f4a901c807a7d4c498306f6717bbb4e798c5fca674545366fa1226c7b", "kind": "dart", "start": 53406, "end": 53534, "line": 1242}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-53598", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-53598", "text": "'Pairs and connects. Nothing is decoded from it yet beyond its own '\n'battery level — no one on this project has held one to confirm what '\n'its other data means.'", "sha256": "36599d4faab4e1a5df410812861ba22034b10462a688efef0bc9e956c118c397", "kind": "dart", "start": 53598, "end": 53777, "line": 1248}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-53842", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-53842", "text": "'A Howear-branded band (HK8 Ultra, HK8 Pro Max and similar), paired '\n'through the WearFit app family. Banks its own battery report and '\n'whatever else it sends; nothing else derives from it yet.'", "sha256": "cdfe549267eb90617878db98bbd6f7b987dac3f494eaf269b0b5eb09e5a57ef5", "kind": "dart", "start": 53842, "end": 54055, "line": 1255}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-54242", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-54242", "text": "'Pairs directly, no app or account needed. Every sync starts from '\n'now rather than a saved bookmark, so a sync run right after the '\n'RingConn app’s own sync can come back looking emptier than expected '\n'— the ring shares one resume point between whichever app reads it '\n'first.'", "sha256": "2bc7a8f4dfe604ca2524e72f3924424aa31c1b22e0e096b24afca93f2984f725", "kind": "dart", "start": 54242, "end": 54557, "line": 1264}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-54742", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-54742", "text": "'Pairs and banks its raw data in the background, but does not '\n'derive anything from it yet — nobody on this project owns one to '\n'verify its numbers against.'", "sha256": "e227075337d66cce09148442182ae7168045c425600b15c0a4957607b36a7b48", "kind": "dart", "start": 54742, "end": 54919, "line": 1275}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-55096", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-55096", "text": "'A generic Bluetooth ring or band from the family sold under many '\n'storefront names. Pairs and connects, but reports nothing yet — '\n'nobody on this project has held one to verify what its numbers mean.'", "sha256": "2ab2ac95109b5b027a3c65cc59f46fe8ea5d4ef9e86c554e2ce7485f5836eb2b", "kind": "dart", "start": 55096, "end": 55317, "line": 1284}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-55745", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-55745", "text": "'A generic HPlus-family HR band (HPlus, Makibes F68, Zeblaze and '\n'similar). No account, no handshake — it pairs and banks what it '\n'sends, but nothing is decoded into a number yet.'", "sha256": "5225543887babeccfb1210ec44df45364388330a6b72ced1bb7f4f88f6220ad6", "kind": "dart", "start": 55745, "end": 55945, "line": 1299}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-56131", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-56131", "text": "'Pairs and banks its raw data in the background, but does not '\n'derive anything from it yet — nobody on this project owns one to '\n'verify its numbers against.'", "sha256": "e227075337d66cce09148442182ae7168045c425600b15c0a4957607b36a7b48", "kind": "dart", "start": 56131, "end": 56308, "line": 1308}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-56487", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-56487", "text": "'The original Fossil/Skagen hybrid smartwatch line, not the newer '\n'Hybrid HR. Pairs and connects; nothing derives from it yet.'", "sha256": "ff5793f8937ca8a8d91d8eb441ac339b355048bca13004ed555a1b38c3ec9733", "kind": "dart", "start": 56487, "end": 56624, "line": 1317}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-57206", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-57206", "text": "'A Colmi ring. No account, no handshake — it pairs and banks its '\n'history, but nothing is decoded into a number yet.'", "sha256": "22a8a16b5ca01fbd7273c5335c9b148c19432749de6f8022b10877d1b3006c27", "kind": "dart", "start": 57206, "end": 57333, "line": 1330}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-57516", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-57516", "text": "'GBX100, GW-B5600, GMW-B5000, ECB-S100 and current Casio '\n'smartwatches. Pairs and connects; nothing derives from it yet.'", "sha256": "975d5d4fe864e95c8c9d29b82a4becc6162e5f450a801a96bdfe4680c3f26e15", "kind": "dart", "start": 57516, "end": 57647, "line": 1338}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-57821", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-57821", "text": "'Pairs and banks its raw data, but does not derive anything from '\n'it yet — nobody on this project owns one to verify its numbers '\n'against.'", "sha256": "e28acaf237109c4b6a75e35db89d9b91bb0c75f8a6d3a23ea51dc1bcdff8a458", "kind": "dart", "start": 57821, "end": 57980, "line": 1346}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-58134", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-58134", "text": "'Pairs any Espruino/Nordic-UART device generically, not just '\n'Bangle.js-branded watches. Banks raw bytes only; nothing is decoded '\n'into a number.'", "sha256": "65fd5280990599d050188c2147672ecaee84d72445d7166ae4d8d696a1f03f34", "kind": "dart", "start": 58134, "end": 58300, "line": 1355}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-59744", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-59744", "text": "'This phone will pair at most $kMaxConcurrentSecondaryLinks '\n'sensors alongside your band. Remove one to add another.'", "sha256": "d35635be2b1f91acdfe9d43596e840a3ad583f4c231e7c9663b21976b6462fe6", "kind": "dart", "start": 59744, "end": 59879, "line": 1386}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-61478", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-61478", "text": "'That request could not be saved. Please try again.'", "sha256": "f5e690ae515b473bde08df3d6f4c2814af8ce1ccb50ebdb76a841fa47a91587b", "kind": "dart", "start": 61478, "end": 61530, "line": 1420}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-62013", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-62013", "text": "'iOS can only show the system pairing sheet before the app has used '\n'Bluetooth. Close OpenStrap completely, then reopen it — the sheet '\n'appears on its own.'", "sha256": "d065b7d787c7b10e30e907c60a43ffb7df7c26b7cf6225421485e0b6fa28c123", "kind": "dart", "start": 62013, "end": 62193, "line": 1437}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-65710", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-65710", "text": "'My sources'", "sha256": "1707aeace32e09729eddf6c9c783c43b5f4d3542bf2c88ebd30e82846a24a25a", "kind": "dart", "start": 65710, "end": 65722, "line": 1535}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-66314", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-66314", "text": "'No band is paired'", "sha256": "942d8b6f8e11a84b75e889dce7a06c8790c0cfde7a79bfcf53c36052e785c5b9", "kind": "dart", "start": 66314, "end": 66333, "line": 1548}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-66423", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-66423", "text": "'Nothing is measuring yet'", "sha256": "cafe2df82926386026f1ad08858c11a9299c16d83a8e6148defc6cfaae91d451", "kind": "dart", "start": 66423, "end": 66449, "line": 1550}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-66572", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-66572", "text": "'The phone counts steps and nothing else. Heart '\n'rate, sleep, recovery and temperature all abstain '\n'until a band is paired.'", "sha256": "49b77de9dde80113a7f526f4170daf301e02645468a6760faeff3994546d7230", "kind": "dart", "start": 66572, "end": 66764, "line": 1553}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-66855", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-66855", "text": "'No band is paired and no phone steps are arriving, '\n'so every metric in the app will abstain rather '\n'than estimate.'", "sha256": "3df2df900c6dd56b888a38cba16426747453744dd67cc5642da6a95db603c308", "kind": "dart", "start": 66855, "end": 67039, "line": 1557}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-67090", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-67090", "text": "'Pair a band'", "sha256": "01bfc55318333fac7cf387787d3a54c6ddfb59e89564a580b3137fd0c0fdc95b", "kind": "dart", "start": 67090, "end": 67103, "line": 1560}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart:offset-68699", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/devices.dart", "location": "offset-68699", "text": "'Add a sensor'", "sha256": "acbd0a1a5037da42380da406f7e1fec6179c9703c3534a3ee0bc36ea82e8fcf4", "kind": "dart", "start": 68699, "end": 68713, "line": 1591}
